# MiniMax-M3.1-Flash's prompt rate with 128-row prompt units (T_MAX 16 -> 128), bloomery-serve at the serving defaults
# on the RTX A6000 + host, depth-serve arms at D = 512 and 4096.
# Before: pp512 39.3, pp4096 36.5 tok/s with 16-row units [measured, int039 89215ba20]. Per unit and layer the host
# reads each distinct expert once and runs one MAC per (row, expert) slot; the wall is the larger of the two:
# 16 rows read 42.5 experts (1.35 GB, 10.2 ms at 133 GB/s) against 54 slots x c (3.6-4.3 ms), DRAM-bound;
# 128 rows read 106 experts (3.38 GB, 25.4 ms) against 433 slots x c (28.6-34.6 ms, c = 66-80 us), MAC-bound [derived].
# Card front ~2 ms and PCIe ~0.25 ms sit under the host's time. pp512 55..77, pp4096 55..75 [derived].
